Not a published download pin; platform build/proof qualification is separate.
Includes private Windows setup transaction exclusion and request-correlation port; not release-qualified.
Bello native command-output selection and asynchronous tools for OpenAI Codex rust-v0.161.0.

Modifications: optional short focus, local output selection after native execution,
315-second selection transport, authenticated Windows loopback transport,
private selector environment isolation, direct and code-mode output integration,
opt-in event-driven tools with append-only result delivery, and tests.
